# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
# └ imperative, lowercase, no trailing period, whole line <= 72 chars
#
#
# Why this change was needed. The diff already shows what changed.
# Wrap at 72 columns.
#
# Refs: #<card>
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Types
#   feat      a new capability                        -> minor version
#   fix       a defect repair                         -> patch version
#   docs      documentation only
#   refactor  restructuring, no behaviour change
#   perf      performance improvement                 -> patch version
#   test      adding or correcting tests
#   build     build system, dependencies, Dockerfiles
#   ci        pipelines and workflows
#   chore     maintenance that fits nothing else
#   revert    reverting a previous commit
#
# Breaking change: feat(scope)!: ...
#                  or a BREAKING CHANGE: footer with the migration path.
#
# Refs: is REQUIRED and names the Kanban card.
#
# English only. No tool attribution trailers, no session URLs, no notes
# about how the content was produced.
#
# Enable with:  git config commit.template .gitmessage
# Full rules:   AGENTS.md sections 4, 5 and 6
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
